<title>USA: Continental Health extends exchange offer.</title>
<headline>Continental Health extends exchange offer.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD CLIFFS, N.J. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Health Affiliates Inc said on Friday that it had extended its offer to exchange its 14-1/8 percent Subordinated Debentures for Convertible Preferred Stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the expiration date had been extended to 12 a.m. EDT, October 4.</p>
<p>The company has extended the offer to allow sufficient time for debentureholders to review the earnings report for its year-end on June 30, 1996. It is expected to be announced by September 30. Pursuant to the terms of the offer, interest will continue to be paid on the debentures.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
